{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54211","headline":"和征妇寄寒衣 · 方干","name":"和征妇寄寒衣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"西风吹雁到东吴，自整寒衣欲寄夫。\n一剪一鍼肠一断，不知夫亦断肠无。\n（见清王魏胜《安州诗录》卷一。\n此诗承张靖龙同志录示）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54211.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54211","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}